{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdZA3NLuMmhA57hF8E5c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The check that led to Dartmouth Provost Santiago Schnell's resignation had a useful design. After Semafor's AI filter found his August Washington Post column on AI cheating to be entirely written by AI, the student paper The Dartmouth ran his other publications through a detector. Writing from before ChatGPT's 2022 public release was found to be human-written, while his recent writing showed high rates of AI use. Older work that predates the tool makes a more informative comparison than a single flagged column.\n\nThe article gives limits on how far those results go. It does not name the detectors or say how accurate they are, and the findings are the paper's and Semafor's, not an independent verification. One of the flagged texts shows the difficulty. Schnell emailed the paper that he uses AI for \"language refinement, copyediting, improving clarity and organization,\" and the paper's detector classed that email as AI-written. He said he developed the substance and wrote a draft, then used an AI tool for language and clarity. The article does not establish how much the tool changed, so the flag and his explanation could both describe the same text. A detector result raises the question of degree without answering it.\n\nThe degree question is what the faculty committee addressed. It found that Schnell used AI to \"meaningfully alter his writing\" and \"was not forthcoming about his AI use,\" though the article does not describe the evidence it weighed. Schnell resigned Wednesday, and President Sian Leah Beilock said the decision was his. He referred questions to his attorneys, who had not responded to the AP."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1166,"cache_read_input_tokens":6017,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1166},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"92b14bfc-b269-494b-a37d-3c81f9d46641","uuid":"dc484074-1ac1-4b64-b770-d858a9c63128","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:33:09.028Z","request_id":"req_011CgdZA36iW2JE73LVGPTHC"}
